  "version": "0.15.0-alpha.4",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.15.0-alpha.4 - 2026-06-12\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Let the daemon start normally on Linux servers and containers without a graphical session by automatically disabling system clipboard access there (#1055)\n- Make Linux clipboard capture more reliable when X11 or XWayland apps update the clipboard while the app is already reading it (#1054)\n- Improve file clipboard entries by showing the deleted-file message, preserving cancelled transfer status after reload, and hiding unknown file sizes instead of showing bogus values (#1053)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.15.0-alpha.4 - 2026-06-12\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 在没有图形会话的 Linux 服务器和容器中，守护进程会自动禁用系统剪贴板并正常启动 (#1055)\n- 提升 Linux 上通过 X11 或 XWayland 应用更新剪贴板时的捕获可靠性，减少复制后没有同步的情况 (#1054)\n- 改进文件剪贴板条目：显示文件已删除提示，重新加载后保留已取消的传输状态，并隐藏未知文件大小而不是显示错误数值 (#1053)",
